          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(3x-6)(5x+10)&=0\\\\15(x-2)(x+2)&=0\\\\x-2&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x+2=0\\\\x&=2\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=-2\\end{align*}$$",
